# Docker matches these against the full path relative to the context root, NOT
# with .gitignore semantics — a bare `node_modules` matches only ./node_modules
# and would let this pnpm workspace's server/ and pwa/ trees into the context,
# where they'd clobber the symlink trees `pnpm install` builds in the image.
# The `**/` prefix is load-bearing; don't "simplify" it away.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.env
.env.local
data
**/coverage
*.log
docs
